te the tough look against the lefty Prielipp. We have elected to bench **Braden Montgomery** (48.31) and remain without **Yainer Diaz** and **Justin Crawford** due to their current status, keeping our focus squarely on the active production of players like **Masyn Winn** and **Luis Arraez** to maintain our competitive edge in the 5x5 format.",
